    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SMASH THROUGH WALLS USING TELEKINETIC POWERS!</strong></h2><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/338d13672a3ea3db9c0144ec74f554a3.poster.avif?t=1655273537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/338d13672a3ea3db9c0144ec74f554a3.webm?t=1655273537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/338d13672a3ea3db9c0144ec74f554a3.mp4?t=1655273537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Try the free demo<br>Okay, so now that we have your attention,  you'll find more about the game below!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play as Euclid of Alexandria!</strong></h2><br>                                                 <strong> <i>&quot;West Alexandria, born and raised, the Great Library is where I spent most of my days...&quot; </i></strong><br><i>                                                                                                                                       - Euclid of Alexandria, probably</i><br><br><br>    <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/41d4c5642bbbb3966749f86d46bc7b6b.poster.avif?t=1655273537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/41d4c5642bbbb3966749f86d46bc7b6b.webm?t=1655273537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/41d4c5642bbbb3966749f86d46bc7b6b.mp4?t=1655273537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Euclid spends his days in the Library going through ancient texts on geometry, writing his own great work. But it would seem Euclid isn't at his station right now.<br>Where could he have gone, and what is that light?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Great Library!</strong></h2><br><br>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/dd7b830303a537c361937cb5078befb4.poster.avif?t=1655273537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/dd7b830303a537c361937cb5078befb4.webm?t=1655273537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/dd7b830303a537c361937cb5078befb4.mp4?t=1655273537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Oops, it would seem he's roaming the Library again. <br>Who knows what kind of secrets he might discover this time!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use the FORCE...</strong></h2><br><br>...Energy and Matter, or combine them in creative ways!<br><br>    <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/4a165fac141188df57d9344464ed5da1.poster.avif?t=1655273537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/4a165fac141188df57d9344464ed5da1.webm?t=1655273537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722120/extras/4a165fac141188df57d9344464ed5da1.mp4?t=1655273537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
